Mysterious monsters have been discovered
at Swamp of Twilight. They appear to be 
a new legion of Mokova. Investigation shows
that the monsters are very strong, but
their numbers are not great at this time
thus two adventurers would be able to deal
with them. If you are confident enough, you
may challenge them alone.
